  "Notes": [
    {
      "Text": "Security update for qemu",
      "Title": "Topic",
      "Type": "Summary"
    },
    {
      "Text": "This update for qemu fixes the following issue:\n\n- CVE-2026-3886: QEMU calc_image_hostmem Integer Overflow Local Privilege Escalation Vulnerability (bsc#1268061).\n\nChanges for qemu:\n\n- Bug fixes:\n  * target/s390x: Make container ids in SysIB_15x 1-based (bsc#1275490)\n  * target/s390x: move @deprecated-props to CpuModelExpansion Info (bsc#1273447)\n  * target/s390x: filter deprecated properties based on model expansion type (bsc#1273447)\n  * target/s390x: flag te and cte as deprecated (bsc#1273447)\n  * target/s390x: report deprecated-props in cpu-model-expansion reply (bcs#1273447)\n",
      "Title": "Details",
      "Type": "General"
    },
    {
